se, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e3a75692/uploads/origins/319a6ab1-1850-49d6-9f14-cb2ff2d483c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b0d71a4d40aa6b37d2de36130a3b22d3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e3a75692/uploads/origins/319a6ab1-1850-49d6-9f14-cb2ff2d483c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b0d71a4d40aa6b37d2de36130a3b22d3, https://si.imgix.net/e3a75692/uploads/origins/319a6ab1-1850-49d6-9f14-cb2ff2d483c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=652797c2574488c649f4db0f9a1f263d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e3a75692/uploads/origins/319a6ab1-1850-49d6-9f14-cb2ff2d483c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d0085340a889baa604e9f97c0a7e2a9d 3x"}, "body": "Thank you for taking all my past commissions! I request art of another vtuber names Matsuro Meru. She is a cute snail girl that delivers mail. She is a multitalented girl that plays retro games, plays bass, and draws art. She is usually very cheery and sometimes slightly bratty. She's eerily similar to the lion girl that you have drawn before.\n\nPlease draw Meru enjoying her favorite alcoholic drink in the reference. It's called a caesar. This is meant to be similar to your previous work: https://skeb.jp/@l_o_a_f_/works/12\n\nThe cardboard box is her new mascot. Please use the outfit in the reference. Feel free to omit the blue cape, hat, and glasses to handle the summer heat. Use any satisfied blushing expression from enjoying the drink. Any table angle is ok, but be sure to play into her very short stature. If possible, a transparent version is appreciated. Thank you for your consideration as always!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1HtBqH2MHzyovWjH1x_iguUChfN010vs7?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@l_o_a_f_/